  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAFIN Sustainable Bond Technical Assistance Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAFIN is seeking technical assistance from GGGI to address: 1.       Lack of an internal process to guarantee the transparent and objective identification and selection of eligible green and social projects.2.       Lack of an internal process to monitor and track the allocation and impact of bond proceeds.3.       Lack of agreed upon reporting indicators to facilitate the development and publication of impact report. 4.       Out of date, low quality Sustainable Bond Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides demand-led technical assistance to NAFIN to complete multiple sustainable bonds emissions to raise capital (at least US$ 300 million) earmarked to green and social projects contributing to Mexico&#xb4;s climate change ambitions and post-COVID recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
